    {
      "id": "i1",
      "content": "To begin the process in the Admin Office, first check if it has started."
    },
    {
      "id": "i2",
      "content": "After that, verify the completeness of the invoices."
    },
    {
      "id": "i4",
      "content": "If they are marked as \"Uncompleted\", they should be returned to the client through postal mail. However, if they are marked as \"Completed\", the process should be continued."
    },
    {
      "id": "i10",
      "content": "Once the invoices are returned to the client, receive the completed ones."
    },
    {
      "id": "i11",
      "content": "Then, mark the relevant box on the invoice entry form and proceed with checking if the process has been completed."
    },
    {
      "id": "i12",
      "content": "Finally, the process ends."
    }
